  "lessons": [
    {
      "key": "Capstone Project",
      "name": "Capstone Project",
      "absolute_position": 1,
      "lockable": false,
      "has_lesson_plan": true,
      "relative_position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "overview": "**How do you decide what to build, what to change, and what to leave out?**\n\nThis 10-day capstone gives student teams the extended time and structure to build a web app with AI from idea to working prototype. Rather than starting fresh each unit, students carry one project through five milestones with three benchmark check-ins built in for reflection and replanning.\n\nYour primary role is to keep students moving between planning, building, and testing rather than treating any phase as a one-time event. Watch for teams that rush into code before they can explain their system, or that treat benchmarks as deadlines rather than moments to recalibrate. The Kanban Board and Project Leader role are designed to distribute ownership across the team — use them as conversation anchors when groups seem stuck or unbalanced. Assessment draws on the Project Guide, Kanban Board, and the working app together.",
        "student_overview": "**How do you decide what to build, what to change, and what to leave out?**\n\nIn this capstone, your team will design and build a web app that uses AI and actually see it evolve over time. You'll start by figuring out who your app is for and what problem it solves, then map out how it works as a system, build and test it, gather feedback, and prepare to share a version you can explain and stand behind.\n\nThis project isn't about finishing the most features. It's about making smart decisions: what to build first, what to test, what feedback to act on, and what to intentionally leave for later. You'll use a Kanban Board to track your team's work and a Project Guide to document your thinking at each milestone — because how you make decisions matters just as much as what you build."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "lesson.key": "Capstone Project",
        "lesson_group.key": "lessonGroup-2",
        "script.name": "web-apps-with-ai-capstone-project-pilot-2025"
      }
    }
  ],
